<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's electronic share trading system down.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's electronic share trading system down.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johanneburg Equity Trading system at the Johannesburg Stock Exchange was down on Friday, exchange officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>The system malfunctioned at the 0730 GMT opening before being restored shortly afterwards, but failed again at around 0800 GMT, dealers said.</p>
<p>The exchange said it was working on the problem.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
